  <h3>\n\n\n\n\n   <a href=\"/en/bible-teachings/science/was-it-designed/glass-frog-anticlotting/\">\n      \n         The Anticlotting Ability of the Glass Frog​—Was It Designed?\n      \n   </a>\n\n\n\n\n   </h3>\n\n\n\n   \n   \n      <p class=\"desc\">This tiny frog moves most of its red blood cells into its liver, which would normally cause a life-threatening clot. How does it survive?</p>\n   \n\n\n\n   \n   \n\n   \n\n\n\n   \n   \n\n</div>","link":"https://www.jw.org/en/bible-teachings/science/was-it-designed/glass-frog-anticlotting/","retrieved":1784840123401},{"title":"Josette Garcia: Preaching for Decades in One of the Hottest Countries in the World (JW.org What's New)","contents":"<div class=\"syn-img sqs \">\n               \n\n   <a href=\"/en/library/series/life-stories-jehovahs-witnesses/Josette-Garcia-Preaching-for-Decades-in-One-of-the-Hottest-Countries-in-the-World/\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-page-id=\"mid502400127\">\n      \n         <img alt=\"Josette Garcia.\" data-largest=\"https://cms-imgp.jw-cdn.org/img/p/502400127/univ/art/502400127_univ_sqs_lg.jpg\" data-smallest=\"https://cms-imgp.jw-cdn.org/img/p/502400127/univ/art/502400127_univ_sqs_xs.jpg\" src=\"https://cms-imgp.jw-cdn.org/img/p/502400127/univ/art/502400127_univ_sqs_lg.jpg\">\n      \n   </a>\n\n\n\n\n   \n   \n\n\n\n\n            </div>\n         \n      \n\n      <div class=\"syn-body sqs   \">\n\n   \n   <p class=\"meta pubDate\">2026-07-20</p>\n\n\n\n   \n\n<p class=\"contextTitle\">\n   \n      LIFE STORIES\n   \n</p>\n\n\n\n\n   \n   <h3>\n\n\n\n\n   <a href=\"/en/library/series/life-stories-jehovahs-witnesses/Josette-Garcia-Preaching-for-Decades-in-One-of-the-Hottest-Countries-in-the-World/\">\n      \n         Josette Garcia: Preaching for Decades in One of the Hottest Countries in the World\n      \n   </a>\n\n\n\n\n   </h3>\n\n\n\n   \n   \n      <p class=\"desc\">For Josette, life in Mali was challenging. But she found joy in serving there for many years as a special pion